 "remarks": "Welcome to 913 Foxboro Drive, a quiet and secluded 2-bedroom, 2-bath townhouse in Norwalk offering 1,318 square feet of comfortable living space. Inside, you will find an updated kitchen that flows easily into the main living areas, creating an inviting layout for daily living and entertaining. The spacious primary suite features a full bathroom with double sinks and a walk-in closet, accompanied by a second full bathroom and bedroom for guests. Additional highlights include a private deck for outdoor relaxation, a versatile finished basement ideal for a media room or home office, and a welcoming 1-car garage--not to mention ample parking for guests. Built in 1989 and featuring efficient natural gas forced-air heating, this property blends privacy with everyday convenience. It is set in a peaceful and well-maintained complex with in-ground pool and nature throughout. You are still just minutes from all the vibrant shopping and dining conveniences along Main Avenue, including Walmart, Chipotle, TJ Maxx, Michele's Pies, and many more local favorites--not to mention full beach rights. This move-in-ready property delivers low-maintenance living in an unbeatable location with easy access to major commuting routes, parks, and beaches throughout Fairfield County.",
